"React 19 · Vite · Cloudflare Functions · D1 · R2 · Zod\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",null,{\\\"caseStudy\\\":{\\\"publicationStatus\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"revision\\\":2,\\\"publishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-27\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"creative-workbench\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"design\\\",\\\"year\\\":\\\"2026\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"CSTD Design 创作工作台\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"CSTD Design creative workbench\\\"},\\\"kicker\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"生成式媒体 / 私有工作流\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Generative media / private workflow\\\"},\\\"summary\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"一个给自己使用的中文创作工作台：对话可以分支，图片和视频任务可以恢复，素材始终找得到来源。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"A private Chinese workbench where conversations branch, image and video jobs can recover, and every asset keeps its source.\\\"},\\\"film\\\":{\\\"durationSeconds\\\":100,\\\"logline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"把生成式创作从一个输入框扩展成可分支、可追溯的私人工作台。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Expanding generative creation from one prompt box into a private, traceable branching workbench.\\\"},\\\"beats\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prompt-box\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"problem\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"创作不是一次请求\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Creation is not one request\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"文字、图片、视频、版本和回退无法被压进单一对话流而不丢失上下文。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Text, images, video, versions, and retries cannot fit into one chat stream without losing context.\\\"},\\\"signal\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"素材必须成为一等对象\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Artifacts must be first-class objects\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"private-boundaries\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"constraint\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"私人系统也有滥用边界\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Private tools still need abuse boundaries\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"流式任务、媒体上传、存储成本与错误重试都需要明确额度和状态。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Streaming jobs, media uploads, storage cost, and retries need explicit limits and state.\\\"},\\\"signal\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"自由创作需要清晰约束\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Creative freedom needs clear constraints\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"unified-model\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"architecture\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"消息、分支与素材统一建模\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Model messages, branches, and artifacts together\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"会话保存意图，分支保存探索，素材记录生成来源和持久地址。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Conversations retain intent, branches preserve exploration, and artifacts retain provenance and durable addresses.\\\"},\\\"signal\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"每次生成都可寻址\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Every generation is addressable\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"storage-split\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"decision\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"元数据与大对象分层\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Separate metadata from large objects\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"D1 负责关系和状态，R2 负责图片与视频，队列负责耗时工作。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"D1 owns relations and state, R2 owns images and video, and queues own long-running work.\\\"},\\\"signal\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"存储结构跟随访问模式\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Storage follows access patterns\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"creative-proof\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"outcome\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"创作过程可以被恢复\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"The creative process can be resumed\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"刷新、分支切换与失败重试都回到同一份持久状态，不依赖浏览器偶然记忆。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Refreshes, branch switches, and retries return to one durable state rather than accidental browser memory.\\\"},\\\"signal\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"工作台记得每次选择\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"The workbench remembers every choice\\\"}}]},\\\"role\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"产品、交互、全栈与安全\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Product, interaction, full stack, and security\\\"},\\\"image\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/cstd-projects/design.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"CSTD Design 创作工作台\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"CSTD Design creative workbench\\\"},\\\"position\\\":\\\"50% 20%\\\"},\\\"technologies\\\":[\\\"React 19\\\",\\\"Vite\\\",\\\"Cloudflare Functions\\\",\\\"D1\\\",\\\"R2\\\",\\\"Zod\\\"],\\\"metrics\\\":[{\\\"value\\\":\\\"4\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"参考图上限\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"reference images\\\"}},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"媒体工作流\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"media workflows\\\"}},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"D1/R2\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"元数据与媒体分层\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"metadata and media split\\\"}}],\\\"evidence\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可恢复\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Recoverable\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"消息线程、分支和任务状态跨刷新持久化。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Threads, branches, and job state survive refreshes.\\\"}},{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可访问\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Accessible\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"键盘搜索、明确状态和自定义确认流程覆盖高频操作。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Keyboard search, explicit states, and confirmation flows cover repeated actions.\\\"}},{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可验证\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Verifiable\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Vitest、Testing Library 与 CI/CD 持续检查。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Vitest, Testing Library, and CI/CD provide continuous checks.\\\"}}],\\\"capabilityIds\\\":[\\\"ai-creation\\\",\\\"product-surfaces\\\"],\\\"relatedNoteSlugs\\\":[],\\\"relatedLabSlugs\\\":[\\\"agent-replay\\\",\\\"render-lab\\\"],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"lab\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可复现实验 / agent-replay\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Reproducible lab / agent-replay\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"在浏览器中重放核心机制。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Replay the core mechanism in the browser.\\\"},\\\"href\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"/lab/agent-replay\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"/en/lab/agent-replay\\\"},\\\"verifiedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-09\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"lab\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可复现实验 / render-lab\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Reproducible lab / render-lab\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"在浏览器中重放核心机制。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Replay the core mechanism in the browser.\\\"},\\\"href\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"/lab/render-lab\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"/en/lab/render-lab\\\"},\\\"verifiedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-09\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"release\\\",\\\"label\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"CSTD Design 发布提交\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"CSTD Design release commit\\\"},\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"提交 1ed2554 记录私人 API 缓存证据与发布状态。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Commit 1ed2554 records private API cache evidence 